            "text": "<h2>Scratch-Made Cookies, Baked Fresh and Shipped Nationwide</h2><p>Every cookie we make at Sunflour starts with real butter, quality chocolate, and no mixes. Our bakers measure and mix from scratch each morning in our Charlotte kitchens, which means what shows up at your door tastes like a real bakery made it. Because one did.</p><p>We rotate flavors through the year, but you will always find our core lineup available for shipping: Double Chocolate, Midnight Chocolate, Peanut Butter, Oatmeal Golden Raisin, Earl Grey, Swiss Almond, Rainbow Sprinkle, Coffee Cake, and our VGF Classic Chocolate Chip for anyone who needs vegan and gluten-free.</p><h3>Order Cookies Online, Delivered to Your Door</h3><p>Each cookie is a full-sized, bakery-quality cookie. Not the miniature kind. These are the cookies you pick up at the counter and eat while standing over the bag before you get home.</p><p>They ship nationwide via USPS or UPS Priority. Best within 7 days of arrival. If you are buying for a group or want to send a gift, our <a href=\"/collections/cookie-gifts\">cookie gift collection</a> includes curated boxes and themed pouches built specifically for gifting. The <a href=\"/collections/pastry-pouch\">Pastry Pouch</a> is the one-at-a-time send.</p><h3>Charlotte Pickup</h3><p>All flavors are available in our shops daily at Elizabeth, Dilworth, Ballantyne, Harrisburg, and NoDa. Some seasonal flavors rotate through, so availability varies. Call ahead if you are coming for something specific.</p>"
